    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Vuelmora is centered at -17.702744, 108.949704 under Cooperative Commonwealth, with 82,389,000 people across 8 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Vuelmora occupies 6,814,295.07 sq mi / 17,648,943.22 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 3.460130% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Farming, Grassland and Partial forest define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Farming and Partial forest. Population density is 4.668 people/sq km / 12.091 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Harengon, Centaur, Giff, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Glasswell Institute, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Marduthor, Setrimir, Raeshkul, Bastveig, and 3 more.",
